bds 2,0 "Aircraft identification"
date 2026-10-14
preamble
    Aircraft identification (Comm-B).
    Source: ICAO Doc 9871 (ICAO Annex 10 Vol. III) Mode S BDS register definition tables.

items

    BDSID "BDS Identifier"
        definition
            BDS register identifier, fixed 0x20.
